cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Digital Genome Workstation, please cite the software."
title: "Digital Genome Workstation: Interactive, Non-Destructive Editing and Evaluation of Human Genome Variants"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rueda
    given-names: Manuel
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9280-058X"
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/mrueda/digital-genome-workstation"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Digital Genome Workstation is a desktop research environment for editing
  phased human variants without changing the source VCF and immediately
  evaluating predicted biological consequences and external evidence.
keywords:
  - genomics
  - variant interpretation
  - VCF
  - genome editing
  - bioinformatics
